Robustness of the headline ordering. Twenty-six cells under alternative substrates, observation-noise levels, labour supply factors, adjustment coefficients, welfare weights, balancing rounds and perturbed input--output matrices. The fragility of the model is observational rather than technological, the ordering survives a complete change of substrate, and the labour conditional of Section 6.3 reproduces. Generated by `scripts/paper_tables.py` from `results/B6`. Source: `reference_results/`.
